    <bpmn:process id="W_W3254" name="W3254. Asset Disposal Compliance (Data Privacy / BIR / E-Waste)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Disposal (W3239); regulatory audit; policy review
Frequency: Continuous + audit-driven
Volume: Hundreds–thousands of disposals/year
Owner: IT Asset Manager
Participants: IT Asset Mgr, Privacy/DPO (links to VS-91), Sustainability (links to VS-73/VS-25), Finance (links to VS-35), Legal, Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3254 — Asset Disposal Compliance (Data Privacy / BIR / E-Waste)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3254_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3254_Lane1" name="IT Asset Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3254_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3254_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3254_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3254_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3254_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3254_Start3" name="Disposal (W3239); regulatory audit; policy review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3254_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3254_Task4" name="Ensure data-privacy compliance on disposal: certified sanitization (NIST…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ensure data-privacy compliance on disposal: certified sanitization (NIST 800-88) for all data-bearing media (W3239), retain sanitization certificates, manage data-subject obligations (links to VS-91 — secure destruction of personal data per RA 10173); DPO oversight
Responsible (R): IT Asset Mgr / DPO
Accountable (A): IT Asset Manager
Duration: Per disposal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3254_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3254_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3254_Task5" name="Ensure e-waste/environmental compliance: use DENR-accredited TSD vendors (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ensure e-waste/environmental compliance: use DENR-accredited TSD vendors (links to VS-73.2 hazardous/e-waste), document chain-of-custody and disposal method, comply with hazardous-waste registration; manage CSR/donation with sanitization and end-use controls
Responsible (R): IT Asset Mgr / Sustainability
Accountable (A): IT Asset Manager
Duration: Per disposal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3254_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3254_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3254_Task6" name="Ensure financial/BIR compliance: derecognize assets (links to VS-35.3)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ensure financial/BIR compliance: derecognize assets (links to VS-35.3), document disposal for tax (gain/loss, links to VS-79), retain records per BIR 10-year requirement (links to VS-88); support external audit (links to VS-22.2) and privacy/environmental audits
Responsible (R): IT Asset Mgr / Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): IT Asset Manager
Duration: Per disposal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3254_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3254_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3254_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
