        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-528 (ensure controlled execution — Technology Asset Security, Cost &amp; Governance Analytics (PA-99.3).) | - operational: certified sanitization and certificates; operational: accredited vendor and documentation
Owner: IT Asset Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
