    <bpmn:process id="W_W3256" name="W3256. Technology Asset Risk Register &amp; Audit Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Risk-cycle (links to VS-21.2); audit (internal/external); incident
Frequency: Quarterly risk review + audit-driven
Volume: ITAM risk register; audit support
Owner: IT Asset Manager
Participants: IT Asset Mgr, Security (links to VS-27.3), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Audit (links to VS-21), Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3256 — Technology Asset Risk Register &amp; Audit Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3256_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3256_Lane1" name="IT Asset Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3256_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3256_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3256_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3256_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3256_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3256_Start3" name="Risk-cycle (links to VS-21.2); audit (internal/external); incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3256_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3256_Task4" name="IT Asset Mgr/Security maintain ITAM risk register: asset-related risks…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT Asset Mgr/Security maintain ITAM risk register: asset-related risks (EOL/vulnerable W3250, non-compliant licenses W3246, ghost assets W3233, disposal-privacy W3254, lost/stolen W3240), assess likelihood/impact, assign owner and mitigation, track to closure; integrate to enterprise risk register (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): IT Asset Mgr / Security / Risk
Accountable (A): IT Asset Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3256_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3256_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3256_Task5" name="Support internal/external audit (links to VS-21/VS-22.2): provide CMDB (W3233)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Support internal/external audit (links to VS-21/VS-22.2): provide CMDB (W3233), SAM (W3241), disposal certificates (W3239/W3254), license/contract records (W3245), privacy controls (links to VS-91); respond to findings and remediate
Responsible (R): IT Asset Mgr / Audit
Accountable (A): IT Asset Manager
Duration: Per audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3256_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3256_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3256_Task6" name="Continuous improvement: incorporate audit findings, incidents (W3240/W3246)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Continuous improvement: incorporate audit findings, incidents (W3240/W3246), and industry developments into policy (W3253) and controls; report ITAM risk posture to IT steering and audit committee (links to VS-21/VS-36)
Responsible (R): IT Asset Mgr / Risk
Accountable (A): IT Asset Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3256_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3256_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3256_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3256_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-528 (ensure controlled execution — Technology Asset Security, Cost &amp; Governance Analytics (PA-99.3).) | - operational: integration (links to VS-21); operational: proactive controls and timely remediation
Owner: IT Asset Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
